{"id":"491825","name":"萝卜墨斗豆腐汤","author":"厨色生香","authorId":"8319064","desc":"","cover":"images/491825/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红皮萝卜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"豆腐","amount":"半块"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"墨斗干","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"少许"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"香油","amount":"几滴"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"红皮萝卜洗净削皮。","img":"images/491825/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"擦成丝。","img":"images/491825/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"墨斗干用水泡一下。","img":"images/491825/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱姜切丝。香菜洗好切段。","img":"images/491825/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"豆腐切小块。","img":"images/491825/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"油热后下入葱姜丝爆香。","img":"images/491825/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"下入墨斗煸炒。","img":"images/491825/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"下入萝卜丝煸炒。","img":"images/491825/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炒至萝卜丝变软。","img":"images/491825/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入适量水，没过食材即可。","img":"images/491825/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"下入豆腐煮一会。加盐、胡椒粉、鸡精、香油调味。","img":"images/491825/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"装碗中。","img":"images/491825/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"墨斗换成虾皮、海米都可以。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}